 → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView/contextMenu(menuItems:preview:)":{"abstract":[],"title":"contextMenu(menuItems:preview:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView\/contextMenu(menuItems:preview:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview\/contextmenu(menuitems:preview:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"contextMenu","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"M","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"P","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"menuItems","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"M","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preview","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"P","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentat